# Design / research / planning docs — deliberately maintained in the working
# tree but held back from git history until the user says they're ready for
# future devs. Code-adjacent READMEs (graph/README.md, tests/README.md,
# fixture READMEs) are NOT excluded — they describe committed code.
# docs/MODEL_EVAL_PLAN.md is intentionally NOT in this list: it is a project
# artifact and should stay versioned.
SPEC.md
docs/DECISIONS.md
eval/INCLUSION_RULES.md
eval/HARVESTING.md

# Local experiment artifacts, API keys, ad hoc run outputs, scratch
# scoring dumps — these never belong in git. Add patterns here as the
# model-facing work starts producing run artifacts.
.env
.env.*
*.env
/scratch/
/scratch-*/
/eval-runs/
